{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The source’s strongest mechanic is committing the whole swarm to an attack while defending it from a rival swarm. I’m centering the plan on that tension. The engine already provides overhead rendering, procedural animation, menus, and deterministic testing; the plan will build on those systems.\n"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The research resolved an important rule: the ray destroys hostile swarms; sustained stinging defeats the fleeing targets. I’ll preserve that distinction. The multiplayer plan will also separate Hub sessions, couch co-op, and standalone direct connections—the Hub client does not provide standalone matchmaking.\n"}}
